      "extract": "Through the notion of Graver basis, we have obtained extensions of classical results of Bland, Edmonds, and Karp. Our new version applies now to the case of integer- linear programs. As a consequence we have also derived the ﬁrst-ever strongly polynomial-time algorithm for N-fold integer-linear optimization. Our new results also show that Kitahara-Mizuno- style bounds [24] hold in larger generality to include",
